  "section craft-section": "<section class=\"section craft-section\" id=\"craft\"><div class=\"craft-grid\"><div class=\"craft-photo\"><img class=\"\" src=\"assets/images/workshop-2.webp\" alt=\"Workshop image from Dunnio’s current website\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><span class=\"photo-caption\">THE DUNNIO WORKSHOP · VIETNAM</span></div><div class=\"craft-copy\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">BEHIND YOUR GARMENT</p><h2>Good tailoring<br>has a human touch.</h2><p class=\"lede\">The craft is in the decisions: how fabric is cut, how a garment is constructed, and how each detail is checked.</p><p>Explore the people and the workshop behind Dunnio, and see how confirmed designs and measurements become a finished garment.</p><div class=\"craft-links\"><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"https://dunniotailor.com/our-workshop\" data-event=\"cta_click\">Inside our workshop<span aria-hidden=\"true\"> ↗</span></a><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"https://dunniotailor.com/our-tailors\" data-event=\"cta_click\">Meet the craftspeople<span aria-hidden=\"true\"> ↗</span></a></div><div class=\"detail-line\"><span>01 / Cut</span><span>02 / Construct</span><span>03 / Inspect</span></div></div></div></section>",
